# <type>(<scope>): <summary, imperative, <=72 chars, no period>
#
# Why this change (what problem it solves), not a diff narration. Wrap at 72.
#
# Types : feat fix docs test refactor chore ci data
# Scopes: schema rules gen inject validate export ui docs tooling
# Example: feat(rules): add R-COV-01..03 coverage checks
#
# One logical step per commit. Tests/lint must pass before committing.
